{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1000_null", "source_sha256": "43009b656f8e1ad3ad6cd65a8bae11dc82177554091c199f061e0523176fab73", "ja": "地方公演　当日……", "zh": "地方巡演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1fcff606a442d85595fa4a572ce17d7d05c7a94c4530a247b1fe91e0b0e92e31", "ja": "（控え室に名刺入れを忘れてきてしまった。\n見つけたら、急いで受け付けに戻らないと……）", "zh": "（把名片夹忘在休息室了。\n找到的话，得赶紧回接待处才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "e581988c72318408403b81fcc755c32fde70717de4224db22276e3f4a3f052eb", "ja": "あら、{$P$}。\n未来たちとすれ違わなかったの？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。\n你刚才没碰到未来她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "efc2306e0575a9c2f12f35b21811c466ef58319ad9dc4a7d60fa5e7c64051068", "ja": "お疲れさま、伊織。\n会わなかったけど……みんなは？", "zh": "辛苦了，伊织。\n虽然没碰到她们……大家呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "5a008304fd03d77755bd46b2c0bbdf486baef5b4b3305ce709efba08a98896f2", "ja": "今日のケータリングが何か、見に行ってるわ。\n南エリアの名物がたくさんあって面白いからって。", "zh": "她们去看今天的餐饮是什么了。\n听说南部地区有很多特产，觉得很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2a9d5464c3c7f229530058c2de928d8856f6a0a708c30365c44b87c3eef04304", "ja": "はは、そうか。伊織は行かないのか？", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。伊织不去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "86b1b2d6ae5392df581b68eedb9913e286beecb6a4552040f0d66a1279c295fa", "ja": "私はパス。本番前にお腹いっぱいになったら、\n動けなくなりそうだもの。", "zh": "我就不吃了。要是在正式演出前吃得太饱，感觉会动不了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "378a8bc9d60d038dd478c2d3314c652370999077eeead5c35eed2f142b70890e", "ja": "それで、あんたは何しに控え室まで戻ってきたの？", "zh": "所以，你回来休息室是要干什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5baad1f9963b9400bdfa5fe23c08046e88a3b5e364d5d5be91761abd32aec61c", "ja": "あ、そうだ。\n名刺入れを忘れていったと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，对了。我好像把名片夹忘在那里了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "c1956cb1912108852df216588d410745259a350d5e283de34f63b96c641b8ff7", "ja": "それなら、テーブルに置いてあるわよ。", "zh": "那样的话，就放在桌上哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1011_p", "source_sha256": "66306e999d311597df049c05dbf8f772003670de7ec37cdc79bd600a2f24e44c", "ja": "あ、ありがとう。\n助かった……ん？", "zh": "啊，谢谢。帮大忙了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f53857fb344dd407f630a942fc04718140c08e6de705364e01a483f7f12ce29b", "ja": "伊織？　そこをどいてくれないと、\n名刺入れが取れないんだけど……。", "zh": "伊织？你不让开的话，我就拿不到名片夹了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "e2688296f680c1d0fcfaf08766e00d456c2fdeede68eec042d0552d136c5de84", "ja": "イヤよ。", "zh": "不要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "09c34d1b454b60eeaec6c4d763a12ab5bd55b046c054511cbcb6f18204180f8a", "ja": "返してほしかったら、私の言うことを聞きなさい！", "zh": "想让我还给你的话，就乖乖听我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "00b3747765615a5d343649a2d7aba7d47df454d5ac6e9e2a77a32782cfaef898", "ja": "ええっ！？　急にどうしたんだ、伊織。\n冗談はやめて……。", "zh": "诶！？突然怎么了，伊织。\n别开玩笑了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "05b52b0bd06cf2d30a6d4165b3db3e2f02ead57eef78176825dfa257be5a4888", "ja": "冗談なんか言ってないわよ、このトーヘンボク！\nアンタ、いちばん大切な仕事を忘れてるんじゃないの？", "zh": "我才没开玩笑呢，你这个木头脑袋！  \n你是不是忘了最重要的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "90ba6dd951f53281ef7553b16a2ab758b4b5b95ae0e0c912376fa07e86152146", "ja": "あんたは、私たちの何？　ちゃんとプロデューサーの\n仕事をするまで、これは返さないんだから。", "zh": "你到底算我们的什么人啊？在好好尽到制作人的\n职责之前，这个我是不会还给你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1019_p", "source_sha256": "886943fab837340ea2b7f67951429afa242ef7c682931c6579711be1f28e8fb5", "ja": "仕事……。\nもしかして伊織、緊張してるのか……？", "zh": "工作……。\n难道说，伊织你在紧张吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "e96678ac56b0fc804351140181c11cd010488972ba195281925c9067622bde9d", "ja": "ううう、うるさいわね！　緊張で食事も喉を\n通らないなんて、誰も言ってないでしょ！", "zh": "吵、吵死人了！谁说过我紧张到\n连饭都咽不下去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "f75810e6939b296dbf77d34bdd837d4f1d8d7861789d0129a6edcb352bf7228f", "ja": "それに私だけじゃないわ！　みんなのことを安心させる\nって約束できないなら、これは返さないんだから。", "zh": "而且又不只是我！要是你不能保证让大家安心，我可不会把这个还给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1022_p", "source_sha256": "09668934cfd909506ba8c9033fca012994aacd9d6c6970c71b861121f1b9cac7", "ja": "うん、そうだな。伊織の言うとおりだ。", "zh": "嗯，说得对。正如伊织所说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1023_p", "source_sha256": "57fde29412e4255edaa227f9a33045a0c836e02465e0025fe28d33e5de9b839b", "ja": "さすが、『月兎隊』のリーダー！", "zh": "不愧是『月兔队』的队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "70dc93de1df3851842bd8fc24ddd04c81a9abd1a79f975026cd3ce0f9ff0cf30", "ja": "ふふん、当然じゃない♪\n今日の公演、期待してなさいよね！", "zh": "哼哼，这不是理所当然的吗♪\n今天的公演，你就尽管期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0223_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "21402ce3897fdbf49305db2ec04d16fec44f3210545047987c5f1b0a6141d6f0", "ja": "会場にきたお客さんのハートは、私たちが\n必ずいただくんだから。にひひっ♪", "zh": "来到会场的客人们的心，我们一定会全部拿下。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
